msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:172
msgid "A few features and improvements we would like to highlight:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:174
msgid ""
":doc:`Components <../../ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-with-nodes/Composition>` "
"are now the recommended way to write your node. They can be used standalone "
"as well as being composed within a process and both ways are fully support "
"from ``launch`` files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:176
msgid ""
"The :doc:`intra-process communication <../../ROS-Framework/nodes/Working-"
"with-nodes/intra-process/Intra-Process-Communication>` (C++ only) has been "
"improved - both in terms of latency as well as minimizing copies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:177
msgid ""
"The Python client library has been updated to match most of the C++ "
"equivalent and some important bug fixes and improvements have landed related "
"to memory usage and performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:178
msgid ""
"Parameters are now a complete alternative to ``dynamic_reconfigure`` from "
"ROS 1 including constraints like ranges or being read-only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:179
msgid ""
"By relying on (a subset of) `IDL 4.2 <https://www.omg.org/spec/IDL/4.2>`__ "
"for the message generation pipeline it is now possible to use ``.idl`` files "
"(beside ``.msg`` / ``.srv`` / ``.action`` files). This change comes with "
"support for optional UTF-8 encoding for ordinary strings as well as UTF-16 "
"encoded multi-byte strings (see `wide strings design article <https://design."
"ros2.org/articles/wide_strings.html>`__)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:181
msgid "Command line tools related to ``actions`` and ``components``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:182
msgid ""
"Support for Deadline, Lifespan & Liveliness quality of service settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Dashing-Diademata.rst:183
msgid ""
"MoveIt 2 `alpha release <https://github.com/AcutronicRobotics/moveit2/"
"releases/tag/moveit_2_alpha>`__."
msgstr ""

